"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Outpost Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack.

==Overview==
"EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes" is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding ''[[Misko's EX Journal]]'', which is rumored to be in the [[Outpost Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|There's a journal that places the locations of the treasure somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Outpost Ruins}}...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading ''Misko's EX Journal'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

Inside ''Misko's EX Journal'' are clues to the locations of eight [[Hidden Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the eight priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states the green garments of the [[Tingle|man who wished to be a fairy]] can be found at the ruins of a trading outpost, a prison and a village next to popular farmland.<ref>{{Cite|The green garments of the man who wished to be a fairy are hidden {{Color BotW|Red|in the ruins of Hyrule Field}}. Find these pieces {{Color BotW|Red|at the ruins where trade flourished}}...{{Color BotW|Red|at the ruins where sinners were imprisoned}}...and {{Color BotW|Red|at the village next to farmland where many people once gathered}}.|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref> 

[[Tingle's Hood]] can be found in a Hidden Chest buried in the middle of the [[Exchange Ruins]]. The Hidden Chest containing [[Tingle's Shirt]] is buried near the ruins of the [[Castle Town Prison]]. [[Tingle's Tights]] are in a Hidden Chest buried under the remains of a [[Guardian Stalker]] in the southeast of the [[Mabe Village Ruins]]. Each Chest can be dislodged from the ground using the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]], allowing Link to retrieve the [[Armor]] within. "EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes" is completed once all three pieces of [[Tingle's Outfit]] have been obtained.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure that was hidden at Exchange Ruins, Castle Town Prison, and Mabe Village Ruins. You obtained {{Color BotW|Red|Tingle's Outfit}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

